{"unit_id":"XXGxiaoyu__dsh-session-sync#card-zh","repo":"XXGxiaoyu/dsh-session-sync","commit":"7e479369f1b1827ad0b2cf14dce659da3fa0c537","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-sync-xxg（DSH 网页端插件）：在局域网设备之间发现并同步 DSH 会话。它接入 DSH 网页界面，并通过本机状态存储、UDP 设备发现和独立 HTTP 同步服务连接其他设备。主要功能包括浏览远端会话、拉取或推送会话、校验会话 SHA-256、按内容指纹跳过重复导入，以及可选的自动拉取。适合需要在多台局域网设备间搬运或查看 DSH 对话的用户。使用时需设备间网络连通，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:127-159","lib/index.js:265-290","lib/lan.js:85-115","lib/sessions.js:490-505"]}
{"unit_id":"XXGxiaoyu__dsh-session-sync#card-en","repo":"XXGxiaoyu/dsh-session-sync","commit":"7e479369f1b1827ad0b2cf14dce659da3fa0c537","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-sync-xxg is a DSH web plugin for discovering LAN devices and syncing conversations. It adds a web interface, uses UDP discovery and a separate HTTP service, and stores state locally. Users can browse, pull, push, verify, and optionally auto-pull sessions. It needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:127-159","lib/index.js:265-290","lib/lan.js:85-115","lib/sessions.js:490-505"]}
